UI-Mate adapter provenance
==========================

This adapter directly vendors Tencent's official UI-Mate prompt construction,
history collapsing, XML response parser, coordinate scaling, pyautogui action
translation, and optional demonstration workflow from:

  https://github.com/Tencent/UI-Mate
  commit d2b2e0aede83eeacfb1bc86f66503acbc4a6738a
  source archive SHA-256 98d13c2f66cc128d5b96b3c574243d02adb89b27f9a4dab4aae5ef0a7bbf9f28

